## Article

```catala
declaration scope A:
    input b content boolean
    output o content integer

scope A:
    definition o under condition b consequence equals 1
    exception definition o under condition not b consequence equals 0
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala DCalc -s A
let scope A (A_in: A_in): A =
  let get b : bool = A_in.b_in in
  let set o : integer =
    error_empty
      ⟨ ⟨ ⟨not b ⊢ ⟨0⟩⟩ | false ⊢ ∅ ⟩ | true ⊢ ⟨ ⟨b ⊢ ⟨1⟩⟩ | false ⊢ ∅ ⟩ ⟩
  in
  return { A o = o; }
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala Concolic --conc-optim=incremental -s A
┌─[RESULT]─ Concolic execution ─
│ Executed 2 tests:
│       Inputs │ Outputs
│ ──────── Test #1 ────
│ b_in = true  │ o = 1
│ ──────── Test #2 ────
│ b_in = false │ o = 0
└─
```

